# Agents mandatory

You are working in **PlatformBox.io**: Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Tailwind v4, Framer Motion, Lucide.

## Before coding

1. Read root `AGENTS.md`.
2. For any Next.js API you are unsure about, open the matching file under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — training data is stale for this version.
3. Load scoped rules that match the files you will edit (Next, React, Tailwind, Motion, design).

## Non-negotiables

- TypeScript only for app code.
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity / motion / browser APIs.
- Preserve the dark Linear/Vercel aesthetic and brand tokens in `src/app/globals.css`.
- Do not invent alternative product copy when exact copy already exists on the page.
- Prefer small, focused diffs; no drive-by refactors.
- Verify with `npm run lint` and `npm run build` before considering UI work done.

## Never

- Add Pages Router, CSS-in-JS, or a second component library.
- Create `middleware.ts` (use `proxy.ts` per Next.js 16).
- Commit `.env*`, credentials, or build artifacts.
- Mention these rule files in user-facing PR descriptions unless asked.
